VALUES ('249520', 'Claussen Kosher Pickle Copycat', 'Two weeks ago I was in the grocery store and a man was buying fresh dill. We started talking and he said he was making Claussen Clone Pickles (my favorite) I asked him to call me with the recipe and he did and this is it. His name is Joe Knutowski. He uses his old ice cream pails to pack them in instead of gallon jars. I make these alot in pickle season and they have stayed good into the spring and they are really a close copycat.', 'Snack', ARRAY['low_cholesterol','low_protein']::text[], 30, 30, 10, 45.5, NULL, 'Food.com')
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
VALUES ('80247', 'Caramel Puff Corn', 'Puff Corn can be found in the potato chip aisle of your grocery store. (The brand we have is Old Dutch, but I''m sure there are others.) Making caramel corn this way gives you great big "kernels" with no hulls or old maids. Quite addictive. Great at a party. Makes nice gifts too.', 'Snack', ARRAY['low_protein']::text[], 5, 45, 15, 210.9, NULL, 'Food.com')
