VALUES ('9033', 'Ritz Breaded Pork Chops', 'Your hands will get messy with this recipe, so have a paper towel handy! However, once you bite into these juicy pork chops, you won''t care how messy the kitchen is!', 'Lunch', ARRAY['high_protein']::text[], 10, 20, 6, 474.4, NULL, 'Food.com')
